1
00:00:09,284 --> 00:00:18,444
Find your way around AureonCare — App shell · search · help — Sign in, learn the three-pane layout, and find anything in two clicks.

2
00:00:19,068 --> 00:00:32,536
Sign in with the email and password your practice administrator issued.

3
00:00:32,536 --> 00:00:38,209
You land on your dashboard. Everything else hangs off the rail on the left.

4
00:00:38,209 --> 00:00:49,747
Pane 1 is the workspace rail: Home, Scheduling, Patients, Clinical, Billing and the rest, with Settings at the bottom.

5
00:00:49,747 --> 00:01:00,462
Pane 2 lists the modules inside the workspace you picked. Pane 3 is the work itself.

6
00:01:00,462 --> 00:01:12,641
Scheduling ▸ Calendar. Directions in these videos always read workspace ▸ module.

7
00:01:12,641 --> 00:01:23,863
Rather than clicking through, search. The magnifier is in the top bar.

8
00:01:23,863 --> 00:01:35,091
One box covers patients, appointments, claims and tasks. Results are grouped by what they are.

9
00:01:35,091 --> 00:01:42,369
Selecting a result takes you straight to that record.

10
00:01:42,369 --> 00:01:52,352
The bell collects what needs you: denied claims, portal messages, posted payments.

11
00:01:52,352 --> 00:01:57,057
Help opens the guides for the module you are standing in.

12
00:01:57,057 --> 00:02:08,006
The whole workspace switches between dark and light to suit your room.

13
00:02:10,634 --> 00:02:27,334
What you just did

14
00:02:27,950 --> 00:02:36,950
Health | Efficiency | Growth — More in the Getting Started series — the next video is linked on screen.
